flowchart TD
    accTitle: Generated SQL is only a proposal
    accDescr: Schema and metric definitions guide a query proposal that is checked before restricted database execution.
    Question["Question and trusted identity"] --> Context["Relevant schema and metric definitions"]
    Context --> SQL["Generate SQL proposal"]
    SQL --> Gate{"Parse, authorize and bound query"}
    Gate -->|Pass| DB["Read-only database role with row policy"]
    Gate -->|Fail| Clarify["Reject or clarify"]
    DB --> Result["Validate result meaning and explain"]
